Two students try to prepare 2-hydroxybutanoic acid in the laboratory.

{{figure:pdf_visual_01.png}}

Both students oxidise butane-1,2-diol to form P in reaction 1.

One student then reduces P using $\text{LiAlH}_{4}$. Q is formed.

The other student reduces P using $\text{NaBH}_{4}$. R is formed.

{{figure:pdf_visual_02.png}}
